      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DESPICABLE HALEY (7) is a first starter from the Sarah Easey kennel by Equalizer out of Despicable Tayla. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Has a nice profile and expected to measure up at first outing. RHYNO'S GIRL (1) shows ability but remains a maiden after 15 starts. Continues to race well without winning, finishing in the money at the last two runs. Well placed and gets her chance. IBROX SHINE (4) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at Maitland over 400m behind Bizarre Weffalee (23.36) in a Maiden. A big run wouldn't surprise. SUMMER MISTRESS (5) will run well despite no experience on this track.",
